Use the following format:
```json
{
"name": "function_name",
"arguments": {
"arg1": "value1",
...
}
}
```
Replace function_name with the name of the function you want to call. Replace arg1 with the name of the first argument that the function takes. Replace value1 with the value you want to pass for that argument. If the function takes more arguments, add them after arg2. If the function takes no arguments, replace arguments with {}. If you do not want to call a function, replace name with null and arguments with {}. Do not add any other keys or text.
